  "details": "Hello, I have a suggestion today. Some of my friends, both Thai and international, have asked me to suggest that VRChat consider adding a customizable Chat Box system where users can adjust its position (scroll up and down) freely. Many people have mentioned that messages sometimes sink into the character's head due to a height-related avatar bug. This issue is especially common among users with VR headsets, who often have to tilt their heads down to read messages. For mute players, this has been a long-standing problem. Please kindly consider this.",
